s</span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Electrified Icon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Electrified_Icon_9e8d1e.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span> Shoots an Energy Damage attack that covers a large area around the target, this is the Sorcerers' equivalent of the Stone Shower.<br/>New spell in the Winter Update 2007. The player using the Thunderstorm rune is never affected by it.<br/>\nFor the spell, see Thunderstorm.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-object-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<ul><li>The price was changed from 47 to 52 since Summer Update 2024.</li>\n<li>As announced on June 16, 2026, the Vocation Adjustments Update 2026 raised its base power from 45 to 50.</li></ul>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul class=\"creature-list-generic no-results\"><li>This item is not dropped by any creatures.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\" id=\"w-npc-trade-buyfrom\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><table class=\"wikitable sortable\"><tbody><tr><th>NPC</th><th>Location</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\">Price</th></tr><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Alexander\">Alexander</a></td><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Edron\">Edron</a></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">52 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Gold\"><img alt=\"Gold\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Icon_f66d4c.gif\" wi